  "transcript": [
    {
      "clip": "C2-Hladanie",
      "title": "Searching",
      "text": "When did you last struggle to find a document? A report, a drawing or a certificate? In storage, on a shelf, in a box or in a folder."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C4-Cena",
      "title": "The cost of the problem",
      "text": "Searching can take hours. Sometimes it's faster to have documents made again. So you may pay twice for the same thing. With us, you find it in seconds. Introducing Assetin Archives. We turn your archive into a clear digital catalogue."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C4b-Hacik",
      "title": "C4b-Hacik",
      "text": "Scanning an entire archive can be expensive. Our app photographs only the title page."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C5-Teren",
      "title": "On site",
      "text": "The solution starts with the physical documents. Every item, whether a shelf, a box, a binder or a folder, gets a QR code, matching how your archive is organised. An ordinary phone is all you need."
    },
    {
      "clip": "F1-Sken",
      "title": "On the phone",
      "text": "On the phone, we choose the item type, for example a folder or a document, and place it in the hierarchy as it really is. Then we photograph its title page. This gives the item its own digital record."
    },
    {
      "clip": "F4-Kontrola",
      "title": "Review",
      "text": "But a suggestion isn't a final record. A person checks and confirms each value. The photo is proof and stays with the record. Any corrections are made right in the suggestion. The result is a verified, traceable record of the physical document."
    },
    {
      "clip": "F3-Vyhladavanie",
      "title": "Search",
      "text": "Then just type a keyword. The app shows the path to the item and all the extracted data. The keyword is highlighted in the record's metadata."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C8a-Vysledok",
      "title": "C8a-Vysledok",
      "text": "The result: you know for certain which documents you have and exactly where they are. Then you can decide what to keep, what to shred and what to fully scan."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C8-Pilot",
      "title": "How to start",
      "text": "Either you catalogue it yourselves, or we process your archive for you, turnkey."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C8b-Technika",
      "title": "C8b-Technika",
      "text": "The app works in line with your security requirements, online with us or on your own infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C8c-Vyzva",
      "title": "C8c-Vyzva",
      "text": "Let's start with one box, free and with no obligation."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C9-Outro",
      "title": "Conclusion",
      "text": "Assetin Archives."
    },
    {
      "clip": "C7-Hierarchia",
      "title": "C7-Hierarchia",
      "text": "Every item has an exact place in the hierarchy, such as a shelf, a box, a folder or a document."
    }
  ]
}
